Iron Skies aircraft models and textures
======================================

The glTF models, Blender source scenes and camouflage textures under this
directory are original work by the Iron Skies contributors.

Licence: Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0)
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

Attribution: "Iron Skies contributors, CC BY 4.0."

No third-party aircraft geometry, game-ripped models or scanned assets are
included. Reference photographs used while modelling are recorded in
docs/art/aircraft-references.md and are not shipped.

The procedural texture generators in tools/textures/ are MIT-licensed source
code; the images they produce are covered by the CC BY 4.0 notice above.
